00:46:41.402 --> 00:46:42.671
Ayo pergi!

00:46:42.803 --> 00:46:43.772
[geraman]

00:46:49.577 --> 00:46:51.478
[Will] Tidak, tidak, tidak, tidak, tidak, tidak.

00:46:57.184 --> 00:46:58.385
