00:59:38.479 --> 00:59:40.581
-[menabuh gendang]
-[burung layang-layang]

00:59:42.049 --> 00:59:44.185
-[semua bersorak]
-Benar kan? Benar kan? Sudah kubilang.

00:59:44.318 --> 00:59:46.821
Oh, astaga. Fillmore 1?

